            "detailed_description": "<h1>Important notice</h1><p>We have a huge sequel in development, <i>Red Trigger 2</i>, it will be 10 times bigger, much more complex and open. All the characters are fully voice-acted and are full of personality. Interested? Make sure to wishlist it now!<br><br></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><i>Red Trigger</i> is a First Person Shooter (FPS) Puzzle game, inspired by games like <i>Portal</i>, <i>Antichamber</i>, <i>Superliminal</i>, <i>The Witness</i> and more, but very much has its own identity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/1350858bcf3c899349b9900392e58e29.poster.avif?t=1711839179\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/1350858bcf3c899349b9900392e58e29.webm?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/1350858bcf3c899349b9900392e58e29.mp4?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In <i>Red Trigger</i>, the main mechanic revolves around you shooting red blocks called Red Triggers. When you shoot a Red Trigger, it expands, and when you shoot it back, it retracts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/ac3d90ac930132659edb7b867637dcdf.poster.avif?t=1711839179\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/ac3d90ac930132659edb7b867637dcdf.webm?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/ac3d90ac930132659edb7b867637dcdf.mp4?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>However, you can only expand three Red Triggers at a time, so you must manage your energy wisely. You can either retract Red Triggers one at a time, or all at once. Be careful though, you don't want to do that while standing on an extended block over a deep, deep void below you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/cfa0006ce3c3483847fc95684877fdd7.poster.avif?t=1711839179\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/cfa0006ce3c3483847fc95684877fdd7.webm?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/cfa0006ce3c3483847fc95684877fdd7.mp4?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Red Triggers are used in many different ways like making platforms, blocking lasers, holding doors open, powering systems, propelling yourself, inputting codes and more! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/82c84573839d0fc2037fba3c1a6fa3d3.poster.avif?t=1711839179\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/82c84573839d0fc2037fba3c1a6fa3d3.webm?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/82c84573839d0fc2037fba3c1a6fa3d3.mp4?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You play as a computer virus called Red Trigger. Corrupt the computer system you're infiltrating! Beware, this won't be easy, as you'll need to do an escape sequence to return to safety as it crumbles!<br><br><i>Red Trigger</i> was initially final student project made by Maxime Vézina, in Unreal Engine 4. It also won the prize of <i>Choice of the Industry</i> at ImagiNAD in May 2016, as well as <i>Best Indie Game 2016</i> from <i>Waiting4Players</i>. <br><br>Since then, Maxime gained experience in the Triple-A Industry and founded his own indie studio, Bold Spirit Game Studio. In 2023, this game has been remade from scratch in 2023 from a team of more than 15 people, and contains a ton of new features. It will be updated soon with this new content. The game lasts for about 40 minutes to 1 hour+, depending on the player.<br><br>The studio is also currently making the sequel, <i>Red Trigger 2</i>, which will be 10 times bigger than this game, much more complex and open. Interested? Make sure to wishlist it now!<br><br>",
            "about_the_game": "<i>Red Trigger</i> is a First Person Shooter (FPS) Puzzle game, inspired by games like <i>Portal</i>, <i>Antichamber</i>, <i>Superliminal</i>, <i>The Witness</i> and more, but very much has its own identity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/1350858bcf3c899349b9900392e58e29.poster.avif?t=1711839179\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/1350858bcf3c899349b9900392e58e29.webm?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/1350858bcf3c899349b9900392e58e29.mp4?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In <i>Red Trigger</i>, the main mechanic revolves around you shooting red blocks called Red Triggers. When you shoot a Red Trigger, it expands, and when you shoot it back, it retracts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/ac3d90ac930132659edb7b867637dcdf.poster.avif?t=1711839179\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/ac3d90ac930132659edb7b867637dcdf.webm?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/ac3d90ac930132659edb7b867637dcdf.mp4?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>However, you can only expand three Red Triggers at a time, so you must manage your energy wisely. You can either retract Red Triggers one at a time, or all at once. Be careful though, you don't want to do that while standing on an extended block over a deep, deep void below you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/cfa0006ce3c3483847fc95684877fdd7.poster.avif?t=1711839179\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/cfa0006ce3c3483847fc95684877fdd7.webm?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/cfa0006ce3c3483847fc95684877fdd7.mp4?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Red Triggers are used in many different ways like making platforms, blocking lasers, holding doors open, powering systems, propelling yourself, inputting codes and more! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/82c84573839d0fc2037fba3c1a6fa3d3.poster.avif?t=1711839179\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/82c84573839d0fc2037fba3c1a6fa3d3.webm?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491130/extras/82c84573839d0fc2037fba3c1a6fa3d3.mp4?t=1711839179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You play as a computer virus called Red Trigger. Corrupt the computer system you're infiltrating! Beware, this won't be easy, as you'll need to do an escape sequence to return to safety as it crumbles!<br><br><i>Red Trigger</i> was initially final student project made by Maxime Vézina, in Unreal Engine 4. It also won the prize of <i>Choice of the Industry</i> at ImagiNAD in May 2016, as well as <i>Best Indie Game 2016</i> from <i>Waiting4Players</i>. <br><br>Since then, Maxime gained experience in the Triple-A Industry and founded his own indie studio, Bold Spirit Game Studio. In 2023, this game has been remade from scratch in 2023 from a team of more than 15 people, and contains a ton of new features. It will be updated soon with this new content. The game lasts for about 40 minutes to 1 hour+, depending on the player.<br><br>The studio is also currently making the sequel, <i>Red Trigger 2</i>, which will be 10 times bigger than this game, much more complex and open. Interested? Make sure to wishlist it now!<br><br>",
